{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-79","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：可公度量与截差无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"To an apotome only one rational straight line can be annexed which is commensurable with the whole in square only.","book":10,"number":79,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.79","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.79/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":79,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-79@raw-69b5d9bf25c4b792","contentId":"euclid-10-79","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"69b5d9bf25c4b7926712848baec77121a3a4401f7f240e8fc6db06f9141dd533","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-79.statement","euclid-10-79.construction.1","euclid-10-79.proof.1","euclid-10-79.proof.2","euclid-10-79.proof.3","euclid-10-79.proof.4","euclid-10-79.proof.5","euclid-10-79.conclusion","euclid-10-79.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-79.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-79","revisionId":"euclid-10-79@raw-69b5d9bf25c4b792","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d0703d10834e20a329e9783706d2302b08a8afcb405b2165938c3c05697f9c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To an apotome only one rational straight line can be annexed which is commensurable with the whole in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"截差无理线段只可附在有理线段上面,可公度只可合在正方形里。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-79.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-79","revisionId":"euclid-10-79@raw-69b5d9bf25c4b792","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3f2ef0e2443d345526522286bb424a7819a418d272cb39927bba77d76cb17e7","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be an apotome, and BC an annex to it; therefore AC, CB are rational straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是截差无理线段,BC是其附件;因此,AC,CB是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-79.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-79","revisionId":"euclid-10-79@raw-69b5d9bf25c4b792","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec882e06d52bf0d41a12ada4c8cbd3ba11b091b5ab73e4bc0dbe11417edd7704","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that no other rational straight line can be annexed to AB which is commensurable with the whole in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,其他有理线段件不能附在AB件之后,即可公度件,整个正方形件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-79.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-79","revisionId":"euclid-10-79@raw-69b5d9bf25c4b792","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb644e72b2efbe1e2b685078222f256406e06964c7cb4b2cb5b4b3cad5fbadf7","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let BD be so annexed; therefore AD, DB are also rational straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,BD件也列为附件;因此,AD件,DB件也是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度件。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-79.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-79","revisionId":"euclid-10-79@raw-69b5d9bf25c4b792","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"33ac993991b10f2f8474d99c6487a398bc6f4f8fc03eca97fca8128e16325e8b","citations":["euclid-2-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the excess of the squares on AD, DB over twice the rectangle AD, DB is also the excess of the squares on AC, CB over twice the rectangle AC, CB, for both exceed by the same, the square on AB, [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)] therefore, alternately, the excess of the squares on AD, DB over the squares on AC, CB is the excess of twice the rectangle AD, DB over twice the rectangle AC, CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于AD比正方形的AD超出DB,DB比矩形比AD的两倍,DB也是正方形比AC的CB比矩形、AC的两倍,两者的比正方形比AB超出正方形,AB则相加,因此,AC比正方形比正方形比AC超出CB,CB是矩形比AD比AD高出两倍。 [[II. 7](/principles/euclid-2-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-79.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-79","revisionId":"euclid-10-79@raw-69b5d9bf25c4b792","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7786fd51ba3c8570acb6f949434937cf00b17d900e0b78303ba4b8c5cb706c04","citations":["euclid-10-21","euclid-10-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on AD, DB exceed the squares on AC, CB by a rational area, for both are rational; therefore twice the rectangle AD, DB also exceeds twice the rectangle AC, CB by a rational area: which is impossible, for both are medial [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)], and a medial area does not exceed a medial by a rational area. [[X. 26](/principles/euclid-10-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AD,DB比AC,有理比正方形高出CB,CB比有理面积;因此,矩形,AD,DB比矩形,AC比有理面积高出两倍:这是不可能的,因为两者都是中项无理线段,中项无理线段面积不超过中项无理线段比有理面积。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)] [[X. 26](/principles/euclid-10-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-79.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-79","revisionId":"euclid-10-79@raw-69b5d9bf25c4b792","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8340f7f492c270679237a452754ebfba826c0361ad9c667120ffa021d229271","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no other rational straight line can be annexed to AB which is commensurable with the whole in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,不能将其他有理线段件附在AB件之后,即可公度件,整个正方形件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-79.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-79","revisionId":"euclid-10-79@raw-69b5d9bf25c4b792","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b5c29530138e62c3169587e8571990ab91218b8e73a2afe4ee572d64155659cc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore only one rational straight line can be annexed to an apotome which is commensurable with the whole in square only. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,截差无理线段卫星只能附着1 有理线段卫星,可公度卫星,整个正方形卫星。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-79.source","contentId":"euclid-10-79","revisionId":"euclid-10-79@raw-69b5d9bf25c4b792","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f03dfb5f4b331b3e6a98498813f2a21f50b9b946835d96ac3339dd8cdb4e587","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.79/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.79\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d046